# Particles Button — a 48pt round button: a press logs "pressed :)", springs a "+"
# icon (rotate/fade) into a check, and fires a 20-particle Skia Atlas blast; it
# springs back automatically and ignores presses while animating.
# What this test covers: a single press with full settle (blast + check +
# auto reset); presses during the animation (must be ignored by the
# isAnimating guard); pressing right after the auto-reset finishes; a rapid
# burst; a long press; taps beside the button (outside its hit area, no blast).
# expect-log: pressed :)
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/particles-button"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 2500
press 201 437
wait 2500
# During the animation: ignored.
press 201 437
wait 200
press 201 437
wait 200
press 201 437
wait 2500
# Rapid burst.
press 201 437 --count 6 --interval-ms 80
wait 2500
longpress 201 437 900
wait 2500
# Beside the button.
press 300 437
wait 400
press 201 600
wait 800
press 201 437
wait 2500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
